{"id":"5959","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5959_main_cumulonimbus-altocumulonimbogenitus-with-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为特有的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云阴暗底面</span>。云底估计有3000米（9000英尺）高，仍处于中层内。这异常的高 –从堡状高积云发展成积雨云的结果。究其根源，这是高积云性积雨云。远处可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水柱</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，阿斯彭代尔花园","latitude":"纬度: 38° 1' 33'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 6' 55'' E","date":"19 March 2015 1548 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 8, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.15","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.15"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5959_syn_cumulonimbus-altocumulonimbogenitus-with-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当地时间15:00，接近图片拍摄时间，在拍摄地附近出现了槽线（红色箭头标示）。冷锋正在向东抵近。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2015，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5959_upper_cumulonimbus-altocumulonimbogenitus-with-praecipitatio_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>当天早些时候在澳大利亚维多利亚州墨尔本机场的探测（WMO 94866）显示出非常干燥的低层大气。在700至500 hPa，有一些水汽。在700 hPa之上，大气不稳定，有利于中层对流发展。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}